cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Salt Battery Lab: a rebuildable engineering and business study of a sodium salt-battery startup"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
authors:
  - given-names: Aditya
repository-code: "https://github.com/sinhaaditya5/salt-battery-lab"
abstract: >-
  Scripted, evidence-tagged study of an aqueous sodium-ion and salt-derived battery startup idea. It
  covers uMLIP and DFT+U (Quantum ESPRESSO) chemistry, PyBaMM cell models, gas, thermal and abuse
  budgets, CAD, drawings, PCB and firmware, techno-economics, market sizing, a 30-architecture
  feasibility matrix and a go/no-go verdict. Pre-prototype: nothing is measured.
keywords:
  - sodium-ion battery
  - aqueous battery
  - sodium metal chloride
  - DFT+U
  - techno-economic analysis
  - battery energy storage
